/**
 * The public demo: one invented year of Alex, an Individual space, from
 * 1 January to 31 December 2026. Every person, amount and date here is
 * invented, and every number on screen is worked out from these records.
 *
 * The story (told in full, with the monthly summary and the checks, in
 * docs/demo-alex-year.md):
 * - January to June: final year of a design master's in Kraków, a
 *   part-time job (3,400 a month on the 4th), a scholarship (800 on the
 *   15th) and some freelance work. A room in a shared flat (1,650).
 * - February: a laptop repair (1,350, on the card) gives a small deficit.
 * - May: a tax refund of 1,138, marked as extraordinary income.
 * - July and August: the studies and the part-time job have ended; only
 *   freelance income. Both months are in deficit and are covered, with
 *   numbers, by the emergency fund (transfers from Savings), the everyday
 *   account and the credit card. A dental emergency and the move to a
 *   studio happen then. One utilities bill is paid late.
 * - September: a full-time job from the 7th (first salary on the 28th),
 *   a studio (2,600, due on the 29th), a last transfer from Savings, the
 *   Student Loan installment paid three days late, and a subscription
 *   review (Video Streaming cancelled, Music on a cheaper plan from October).
 * - October to December: salary of 6,500, the card is paid back, the
 *   emergency fund is rebuilt, the Christmas money is used for gifts.
 *   On 31 December the Phone & Internet bill (due that day) is still to pay.
 *
 * How the records fit together (see docs/FINANCIAL_RULES.md):
 * - Income arrives in the Everyday Account; bills are paid from it.
 * - Card purchases are spending when bought; paying the card is not.
 * - Each loan installment records its interest; only the interest is
 *   spending, the principal lowers the loan.
 * - Savings move with transfers; goal movements only give the money a purpose.
 * - Balances were read at the end of every month; the records explain
 *   every change exactly (tested in domain/finance/alexDemo.test.ts).
 */
